    "result_text": "All 270 tests pass, including the new `Cp07Tests`. \n\nThe change is complete. I implemented the owner initials feature by:\n\n1. **OpenAPI spec** (`openapi.yml`): Added a read-only `initials` string field to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` includes the getter/setter.\n\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`**: Added a `@Mapping` for `initials` backed by a helper method that takes the first character of the first and last name, upper-cases each, and joins them dot-separated with a trailing dot (e.g. `\"J.S.\"`).\n\nSince the mapper's `toOwnerDto` is shared by both v1 and v2 controllers, initials are computed on both create and read responses. `firstName`/`lastName` are required with `minLength: 1` in the spec, so the first-character access is safe.",
